{"title":"Contact","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Contact","page-layout":"full"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h1>Get in <span class=\"wheat-accent\">Touch</span></h1>\n    <p>We welcome inquiries from prospective students, collaborators, communities, and the public.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"container page-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"row g-5\">\n    <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Contact Information</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"info-panel\">\n        <div class=\"contact-row\"><div><strong>Email</strong><a href=\"mailto:manisha.choudhary@ksu.edu\">manisha.choudhary@ksu.edu</a></div></div>\n        <div class=\"contact-row\"><div><strong>Department</strong><span>Carl and Melinda Helwig Department of Biological and Agricultural Engineering</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"contact-row\"><div><strong>Address</strong><span>920 N. Martin Luther King Jr. Drive<br>Manhattan, KS 66506</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"contact-row\"><div><strong>Office Hours</strong><span>By appointment - email to schedule.</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"contact-row\"><div><strong>Connect</strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/manishachoudhary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LinkedIn</a></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dark-panel mt-4\">\n        <h5>About Manhattan, Kansas</h5>\n        <p>Kansas State University sits in the Flint Hills, a landscape deeply connected to agriculture, water, and land stewardship. That setting makes K-State a strong home for applied environmental research at the interface of engineering and community needs.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Find Us</h2>\n      <div class=\"map-wrap\">\n        <iframe\n          src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3115.4!2d-96.5836!3d39.1955!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x87bdf6b99c4a70c3%3A0x8b5c67e3a7f8c000!2sKansas%20State%20University!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1699000000\"\n          width=\"100%\"\n          height=\"320\"\n          style=\"border:0;\"\n          allowfullscreen=\"\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"\n          title=\"Kansas State University location\">\n        </iframe>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"info-panel mt-4\">\n        <h5>Inquiry Guidance</h5>\n        <div class=\"guidance-row\"><strong>Prospective students:</strong> Send your CV, research interests, and degree interest. See the Join Us page for details.</div>\n        <div class=\"guidance-row\"><strong>Research collaborators:</strong> Briefly describe your project, timeline, and potential overlap with EC² Lab.</div>\n        <div class=\"guidance-row\"><strong>Community partners:</strong> Questions about PFAS, agricultural water, or soil contamination are welcome.</div>\n        <div class=\"guidance-row\"><strong>Media and public inquiries:</strong> Include your topic, outlet, and deadline.</div>\n        <a href=\"mailto:manisha.choudhary@ksu.edu\" class=\"btn-earth mt-3\">Send an Email</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h1>Get in <span class=\"wheat-accent\">Touch</span></h1>\n    <p>We welcome inquiries from prospective students, collaborators, communities, and the public.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"container page-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"row g-5\">\n    <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Contact Information</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"info-panel\">\n        <div class=\"contact-row\"><div><strong>Email</strong><a href=\"mailto:manisha.choudhary@ksu.edu\">manisha.choudhary@ksu.edu</a></div></div>\n        <div class=\"contact-row\"><div><strong>Department</strong><span>Carl and Melinda Helwig Department of 